                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e93f01be-5abe-3b55-b825-39bb11698946",
                        "entry_id": "419d03e9-e7e7-3933-9d59-2acea48bc2c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "saffron milk cap (Lactarius deliciosus)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9a099e1-c2c7-471a-bb04-226639edfc2c",
                                "sense_id": "e93f01be-5abe-3b55-b825-39bb11698946",
                                "text": "— Чего́ же бы тепе́рь, Афана́сий Ива́нович, закуси́ть? ра́зве ко́ржиков с са́лом, и́ли пирожко́в с ма́ком, и́ли, мо́жет быть, ры́жиков солёных?\n— Пожа́луй, хоть и ры́жиков и́ли пирожко́в, — отвеча́л Афана́сий Ива́нович, и на столе́ вдруг явля́лась ска́терть с пирожка́ми и ры́жиками.",
                                "translation": "“What shall we have to eat now, Afanasii Ivanovich—some wheat and tallow cakes, or some pies with poppy-seeds, or some salted mushrooms?”\n“Some mushrooms, then, if you please, or some pies,” replied Afanasii Ivanovich; and then suddenly a table-cloth would make its appearance on the table, with the pies and mushrooms.",
                                "english": "“What shall we have to eat now, Afanasii Ivanovich—some wheat and tallow cakes, or some pies with poppy-seeds, or some salted mushrooms?”\n“Some mushrooms, then, if you please, or some pies,” replied Afanasii Ivanovich; and then suddenly a table-cloth would make its appearance on the table, with the pies and mushrooms."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
